usage: memory_tool remove [-h] [--reason REASON] [--permanent] [--restore]
                          [--prune-trash] [--base BASE] [--dry-run]
                          [source]

positional arguments:
  source           Memory file path, absolute or relative to DIL base

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --reason REASON  Reason for removal (required unless --restore or --prune-
                   trash)
  --permanent      Permanently delete instead of moving to _shared/_trash
  --restore        Restore a memory note from _shared/_trash
  --prune-trash    Permanently delete trash files older than 30 days
  --base BASE      Base vault path override
  --dry-run        Print actions without executing
